  "historyNote": "#4315, eff 9-25-87; EXPIRED: 9-25-93 New. #6360, eff 10-23-96, EXPIRED: 10-23-04 New. #8195, INTERIM, eff 10-29-04, EXPIRED: 4-27-05 New. #8424, eff 9-1-05 (from He-M 517.09) ; ss by #10454, eff 10-31-13; ss by #13988, eff 5-30-24 (formerly He-M 517.07)",
